<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">COLOR TOOLKIT</view>
    <view class="title">找到颜色，也做出自己的颜色</view>
    <view class="subtitle">从图片取色、从基础色生成配色，再把结果整理成自己的色卡。</view>
    <view class="hero-actions">
      <button class="primary" bindtap="openExtractor">从图片取色</button>
      <button class="secondary" bindtap="openCreator">开始创作</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title">精选色卡</view>
  <view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{featured}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="openPalette"><view class="swatches"><view wx:for="{{item.colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="swatch" style="background:{{item}}"></view></view><view class="card-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-meta">{{item.colors.length}} COLORS</view></view></view>
  <view class="panel workflow"><view class="section-title">三步完成一张色卡</view><view class="step"><view class="step-no">01</view><view><view class="step-title">取色</view><view class="muted">上传图片并点击画面中的位置获取颜色。</view></view></view><view class="step"><view class="step-no">02</view><view><view class="step-title">生成</view><view class="muted">选择类似、互补、三角色、粉彩、冷暖等配色方式。</view></view></view><view class="step"><view class="step-no">03</view><view><view class="step-title">收藏</view><view class="muted">把最终颜色组合保存到自己的色卡库。</view></view></view></view>
</view>
